      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rejuvenation",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "Completing the ghost mage's project allows it to move on to the afterlife.\n\n---\n\nWhen a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after 2d4 days within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting."
