      "text": "The ghost laments its fate, forcing each living creature within 30 feet to attempt a DC 29 Will save save. On a failure, a creature becomes Frightened 2 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to this ghost's frightful moan for 1 minute."
    },
